757
00:51:00,640 --> 00:51:05,380
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Today, sir, our life expectancy for the Filipino is 70.5 years old.

758
00:51:05,540 --> 00:51:07,540
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So it is increased already.

759
00:51:07,780 --> 00:51:08,860
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Health is better.

760
00:51:09,020 --> 00:51:10,060
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: They are more productive.

761
00:51:10,380 --> 00:51:14,900
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And the knowledge that they have accumulated through the years are invaluable.

762
00:51:15,780 --> 00:51:17,860
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But I will live with 57,

763
00:51:17,860 --> 00:51:22,160
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: but hopefully over the years we can increase the retirement age

764
00:51:22,160 --> 00:51:26,820
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: because the experience that they gain is much too valuable just to let them retire.

765
00:51:27,480 --> 00:51:30,740
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Pero Mr. Secretary, Secretary, during the hearing,

766
00:51:30,780 --> 00:51:32,780
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: kasi ako chairman ng public order noon,

767
00:51:33,440 --> 00:51:35,920
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: kinuha namin ang inputs ng PNP.

768
00:51:36,100 --> 00:51:39,480
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: And according to them, as a matter of fact, gusto namin 60.

769
00:51:40,000 --> 00:51:42,740
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Pero sabi lang kasi ng PNP hierarchy,

770
00:51:43,240 --> 00:51:43,660
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: ano raw,

771
00:51:44,260 --> 00:51:45,920
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: sama na yung training nila.

772
00:51:46,000 --> 00:51:49,280
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: So pagdating ng 60, medyo exhausted na sila.

773
00:51:49,840 --> 00:51:52,580
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Ang sabi ko nga, nakikita ko pa,

774
00:51:52,660 --> 00:51:54,540
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: yung ibang PNP nga nakakatakbo pa,

775
00:51:54,600 --> 00:51:55,620
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: even after 60.

776
00:51:55,740 --> 00:51:56,040
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Di ba?

777
00:51:56,100 --> 00:51:57,620
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: [unclear] ng hagdan eh.

778
00:51:57,620 --> 00:51:59,520
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Nadadapa nga lang minsan.

779
00:52:00,200 --> 00:52:03,820
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Kaya sila rin, idea rin nila na maging 57 lang.

780
00:52:03,820 --> 00:52:09,340
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: kasi parang sinama nila yung training nila bago sila pumasok sa sa serbisyo.

781
00:52:09,340 --> 00:52:13,860
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, ang 57 is still prime productivity for a policeman.

782
00:52:13,860 --> 00:52:16,600
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I think in this body,

783
00:52:17,440 --> 00:52:19,400
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sino ba 57 years old dito?

784
00:52:19,640 --> 00:52:21,060
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Congressman Richard?

785
00:52:24,120 --> 00:52:27,240
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Si Congressman Richard is only 37 years old.

786
00:52:27,240 --> 00:52:28,780
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, Congressman Teves, I think,

787
00:52:28,800 --> 00:52:33,060
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and a lot of us here are past 57 years old

788
00:52:33,060 --> 00:52:34,240
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: but are still very productive.

789
00:52:34,600 --> 00:52:39,560
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And our wealth of knowledge is incalculable into making the department run better.

790
00:52:39,840 --> 00:52:41,120
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: So, yun lang, Mr. Chair.

791
00:52:41,140 --> 00:52:43,600
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Sa mga tanong pa, wala naman akong masyadong tanong

792
00:52:43,600 --> 00:52:44,480
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: dahil natanong nila.

793
00:52:45,380 --> 00:52:48,500
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: I-move ko lang sana na ibang mga natanggal na budget nila,

794
00:52:48,560 --> 00:52:50,980
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: mahanapan natin ang budget.

795
00:52:50,980 --> 00:52:55,180
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Kasi nakikita ko minsan pag may sunog, parang 5 is to 1,

796
00:52:55,260 --> 00:52:56,960
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: yung volunteer, isa lang yung...

797
00:52:57,340 --> 00:52:57,840
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: eh

798
00:52:57,840 --> 00:53:03,520
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: hindi ko naman masisi dahil ang tingin ko nga, kakulangan din ng budgetary.

799
00:53:03,520 --> 00:53:06,020
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: So kung may magagawa po kami rito sa Kongreso,

800
00:53:06,060 --> 00:53:08,600
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: tutal, naghihimay-himay pa tayo ng budget,

801
00:53:08,920 --> 00:53:12,380
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: malagyan natin ng kaukulang budget tong

802
00:53:12,380 --> 00:53:16,700
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: PNP, Bureau of Fire, and the rest of your family.

803
00:53:17,000 --> 00:53:17,880
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Thank you, Mr. Sec.

804
00:53:18,000 --> 00:53:18,560
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: You're welcome.

805
00:53:18,620 --> 00:53:19,340
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Thank you very much, sir.

806
00:53:19,340 --> 00:53:21,560
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

807
00:53:22,140 --> 00:53:22,640
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you.

808
00:53:22,820 --> 00:53:25,540
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: In addition lang po regarding the fire trucks,

809
00:53:25,800 --> 00:53:33,980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: kung ang DBM lang po ay ibigay kahit 72% ng collection po nila in one year,

810
00:53:34,500 --> 00:53:39,380
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: yung 100 fire trucks natin and even 40 plus fire stations in one year,

811
00:53:39,540 --> 00:53:40,920
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: tapos na po tayo.

812
00:53:41,400 --> 00:53:43,600
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, tulungan po natin sila.

813
00:53:43,640 --> 00:53:47,180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Siguro, there's a need to pressure the DBM para lumabas yung...

814
00:53:47,180 --> 00:53:49,660
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: 25% lang po ng collection nga.

815
00:53:49,660 --> 00:53:53,500
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: We're asking for 72%, so we will support Secretary Remulla.

816
00:53:53,500 --> 00:53:57,180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Since malinis naman po ang BFP.

817
00:53:57,440 --> 00:53:58,840
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Malinis na po natin.

818
00:53:58,880 --> 00:54:00,880
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And the government-to-government also.

819
00:54:01,120 --> 00:54:06,500
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But, Secretary, may I suggest also that not only Korea, let's venture out Japan.

820
00:54:07,220 --> 00:54:09,560
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Kasi yung mga Isuzu parang 40 years.

821
00:54:09,700 --> 00:54:10,800
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We checked it out, sir.

822
00:54:10,900 --> 00:54:12,860
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: It's 30% more expensive.

823
00:54:13,280 --> 00:54:13,700
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Okay.

824
00:54:13,760 --> 00:54:14,120
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yeah.

825
00:54:14,120 --> 00:54:17,860
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, I think Korea is the best option for us right now.

826
00:54:17,860 --> 00:54:18,280
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes.

827
00:54:18,280 --> 00:54:21,700
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: I believe in your wisdom and leadership, Senior Brod.

828
00:54:23,160 --> 00:54:33,100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, before I go to the next interpellator, I would like to recognize Representative Julius Vergara,

829
00:54:33,100 --> 00:54:39,040
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Deputy Majority Leader Alyssa Mica Gonzales,

830
00:54:39,040 --> 00:54:42,900
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Congresswoman Florabel Yatco,

831
00:54:43,120 --> 00:54:45,480
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Representative Zaldy Villa.

832
00:54:47,800 --> 00:54:54,540
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: For the next representative from the minority, may I recognize Representative Percival Cendaña.

833
00:54:54,940 --> 00:54:56,120
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Sir, you have the floor.

834
00:54:58,700 --> 00:54:59,740
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

835
00:54:59,820 --> 00:55:02,840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Magandang umaga po, Mr. Secretary at sa buong DILG family.

836
00:55:03,140 --> 00:55:07,400
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sige po, simulan natin yung unang round with a question on the burning issue.

837
00:55:07,680 --> 00:55:09,240
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Matagal na po natin naririnig.

838
00:55:09,280 --> 00:55:10,600
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ako po, taga-[unclear] Visaya ako,

839
00:55:10,820 --> 00:55:12,160
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: mga kaibigan ko sa North,

840
00:55:12,160 --> 00:55:15,800
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: yung usapin po ng slots for sale sa BFP.

841
00:55:15,960 --> 00:55:19,280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At ito po, recently may nakita tayo, may nahuli na hiring official.

842
00:55:19,760 --> 00:55:22,680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ano po ang nangyayari sa BFP dito sa slots for sale?

843
00:55:22,780 --> 00:55:25,080
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At ano pong ginagawa natin para tugunan nito?

844
00:55:25,300 --> 00:55:28,440
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Number one, sir, the case is officially solved.

845
00:55:28,560 --> 00:55:31,200
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yung slots for sale na isang nahuli natin.

846
00:55:31,540 --> 00:55:40,760
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Right now, I will defer to the BFP chief to explain our new hiring procedures and how we make it almost impossible to have the slots for sale.

847
00:55:40,760 --> 00:55:42,200
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Take note that before this,

848
00:55:42,200 --> 00:55:47,460
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: the slots for sale ranged from 200,000 to 800,000 per slot.

849
00:55:48,100 --> 00:55:53,660
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But for one slot, with our new system, which I will defer to the BFP chief to explain,

850
00:55:53,920 --> 00:55:57,840
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: we will make it almost impossible for that so that the slots will be for sale.

851
00:55:58,040 --> 00:55:58,780
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Chief Kwan Tiu?

852
00:56:00,220 --> 00:56:00,620
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Thank you.

853
00:56:00,620 --> 00:56:04,900
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Thank you very much, Mr. Chair, and Your Honors, and to our good Secretary.

854
00:56:04,900 --> 00:56:08,000
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: To cut the story short, Mr. Chair,

855
00:56:08,000 --> 00:56:20,870
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: the Oplansang Tindig of the BFP, a mechanism that prevents and arrests persons who are into corruptions,

856
00:56:20,880 --> 00:56:24,310
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: not only outside but also the inside personnel of the BFP.

857
00:56:24,320 --> 00:56:34,420
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: It's working, and that is why just recently, nahuli po natin yung isang SFO1 na nag-engage into anomalies.

858
00:56:35,700 --> 00:56:36,400
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Mr. Chair,

859
00:56:36,400 --> 00:56:40,760
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: matagal na pong naging kuwento ng BFP ang slot for sale.

860
00:56:41,100 --> 00:56:50,960
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Gumawa po tayo ng bagong makinarya, and we called it the e-hiring that somehow prevents this kind of people doing anomalies during recruitment.

861
00:56:51,900 --> 00:56:57,400
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: And so far, wala po tayong narinig on the first part of recruitment because it's system-generated.

862
00:56:57,500 --> 00:57:00,740
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: It's online application at the doorstep of their home,

863
00:57:00,880 --> 00:57:02,860
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: pwede na po silang mag-apply sa BFP,

864
00:57:02,880 --> 00:57:03,940
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: wala po silang gagastusin,

865
00:57:03,980 --> 00:57:04,680
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: and during examination,

866
00:57:05,760 --> 00:57:07,500
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: automatically makukuha po nilang result,

867
00:57:07,680 --> 00:57:08,840
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: system-generated po.

868
00:57:08,920 --> 00:57:10,120
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: So natigilan po natin noon.

869
00:57:10,160 --> 00:57:15,340
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: However, as I said, hindi 100% na nagagawa namin kasi human na po itong pagdating sa dulo.

870
00:57:15,640 --> 00:57:25,240
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: So ang ginawa po nung isang bumbero na ito ay tiningnan niya sino po yung umabot na sa stage na kung saan matatapos na po yung recruitment phase sa kanya.

871
00:57:25,500 --> 00:57:32,240
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: So randomly, tiningnan niya sa Facebook at nung may nakita siyang may sumagot sa kanya, nag-offer po siya ng tulong.

872
00:57:32,460 --> 00:57:35,720
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Ito po ay panibagong mekanismo

873
00:57:35,720 --> 00:57:38,380
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: na naman na ginagawa ng mga kasamahan po namin.

874
00:57:38,400 --> 00:57:40,540
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Just very unfortunate na kasamahan nga po namin.

875
00:57:40,840 --> 00:57:48,880
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: The entire men and women of BFP felt sad on what transpired just recently. Kasi nga po lahat kami ang direksyon ay gusto na pong pag-uwi.

876
00:57:49,160 --> 00:57:50,000
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Nahuli na po siya.

877
00:57:50,000 --> 00:57:54,560
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: As I said, epektibo po yung mekanismo ng Oplansang Tindig.

878
00:57:54,560 --> 00:58:02,860
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: And I commend the bravery and courage of that applicant para ho isumbong niya dahil naniniwala siya na nagbabago na ho ang pananaw ng BFP, Mr. Chair.

879
00:58:04,100 --> 00:58:06,100
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Maraming salamat, Mr. Chair.

880
00:58:07,200 --> 00:58:09,120
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At linawin po natin,

881
00:58:09,120 --> 00:58:11,280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: so sana simula pa lamang ito

882
00:58:11,280 --> 00:58:16,940
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: at mas maging matindi sana yung pagbabantay natin kasi nakalulungkot po na may galawang sindikato sa loob ng BFP pagdating po dito sa slots for sale.

883
00:58:16,940 --> 00:58:19,120
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Let me move on to a more pressing issue.

884
00:58:19,320 --> 00:58:25,100
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sa ngayon po, nagluluksa ang buong bansa dito sa sunod-sunod na karahasan sa ating mga eskwelahan.

885
00:58:25,380 --> 00:58:31,480
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Hindi lamang po ito red flag, kundi isa na pong red alert ang nababalitaan natin na school violence.

886
00:58:32,020 --> 00:58:35,440
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Last week lang yung school shooting sa Zamboanga,

887
00:58:35,440 --> 00:58:36,820
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: tapos sa Tacloban, two months ago.

888
00:58:37,080 --> 00:58:38,680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pero hindi po ito yung buong kuwento.

889
00:58:38,820 --> 00:58:47,780
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Recently yung PNP nagsabi that they recorded at least 50 incidents in schools involving children in conflict with the law from June 16 to August 19.

890
00:58:47,980 --> 00:58:55,900
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So ang range po niyan ay bomb threats, alleged shooting threats, stabbing incidents, illegal possession of firearms, death threats.

891
00:58:56,240 --> 00:59:00,780
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Dito po sa nakaraang Senate hearing chaired by our colleague, Sen. Risa Hontiveros,

892
00:59:00,900 --> 00:59:09,540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: the PNP sa Anti-Cybercrime Group said that they had handled 74 cases linked to nihilistic violent extremism,

893
00:59:09,540 --> 00:59:13,780
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: at they rescued 42 minors in connection with these cases.

894
00:59:14,220 --> 00:59:19,380
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Nagbago po ba ang strategy ng DILG at PNP after the recent events?

895
00:59:19,600 --> 00:59:25,180
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At ano po yung mga efforts to closely monitor and apprehend nihilistic violent extremism online?

896
00:59:25,880 --> 00:59:27,700
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, there are two parts to that.

897
00:59:27,820 --> 00:59:30,840
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: One is the physical manifestation

898
00:59:30,840 --> 00:59:35,400
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: of how we deal with the children in conflict with the law

899
00:59:35,400 --> 00:59:36,840
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and how we prevent.

900
00:59:37,580 --> 00:59:46,680
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Again, the PNP is present in all schools in the country during entry and dismissal.

901
00:59:46,680 --> 00:59:47,480
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: That's number one.

902
00:59:47,680 --> 00:59:54,300
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Number two, again, as I repeat, we have barangay tanods who will inspect the bags and identify the children who enter the school.

903
00:59:54,720 --> 00:59:55,240
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: However,

904
00:59:55,440 --> 00:59:59,520
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: what happens in their homes that influence them

905
00:59:59,520 --> 01:00:01,060
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: is beyond our control.

906
01:00:01,520 --> 01:00:07,780
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I urge the country, all of us, the government as a whole,

907
01:00:07,980 --> 01:00:10,340
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: to act on these nihilistic sites

908
01:00:10,340 --> 01:00:12,660
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and have them cancelled as soon as possible.

909
01:00:14,180 --> 01:00:15,880
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Other countries have done that.

910
01:00:16,740 --> 01:00:20,320
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Australia is very successful in handling the use of

911
01:00:20,320 --> 01:00:22,460
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: minors using the internet.

912
01:00:22,860 --> 01:00:26,680
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: China is very good at handling that. It is not

913
01:00:26,680 --> 01:00:28,560
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: censorship but rather

914
01:00:28,560 --> 01:00:31,300
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: it is a filtering out of dangerous

915
01:00:32,200 --> 01:00:35,940
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: sites so that children will not get influenced.

916
01:00:35,940 --> 01:00:42,000
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: You will be surprised at the depravity of these websites.

917
01:00:42,420 --> 01:00:46,840
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: They espouse everything from satanism to nihilism

918
01:00:46,840 --> 01:00:52,480
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: anti-semitism to anti-LGBT,

919
01:00:52,480 --> 01:00:55,180
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and they encourage the children to act on this.

920
01:00:55,320 --> 01:00:55,980
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So this is

921
01:00:55,980 --> 01:00:58,480
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: something that the DICT, the DILG

922
01:00:58,480 --> 01:01:00,860
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and all other governments and even Congress

923
01:01:00,860 --> 01:01:03,660
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: can act upon so that these sites can be banned.

924
01:01:04,960 --> 01:01:07,200
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Thank you very much, Mr. Chair, Mr. Secretary.

925
01:01:07,200 --> 01:01:11,200
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Para lang po sa NYC, ano po ang ginagawa natin

926
01:01:11,200 --> 01:01:16,660
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: para po mailayo yung mga kabataan natin sa mga nihilistic violent extremism?

927
01:01:17,820 --> 01:01:22,540
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Mr. Chair, currently ang NYC po ay nag-a-allocate ng pondo

928
01:01:22,540 --> 01:01:23,920
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: para sa Mental Health Youth Hub.

929
01:01:24,080 --> 01:01:25,720
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Ito po ay ang pagpapadala ng

930
01:01:26,040 --> 01:01:26,780
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: mga mental health

931
01:01:26,780 --> 01:01:28,300
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: peer-to-peer support facilitators

932
01:01:28,300 --> 01:01:31,120
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: sa mga areas gaya ng Zamboanga.

933
01:01:31,120 --> 01:01:35,000
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: So nung nangyari po yung Zamboanga incident,

934
01:01:35,000 --> 01:01:37,100
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: nakipag-usap agad kami sa presidente

935
01:01:37,100 --> 01:01:39,300
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: and minobilize po namin yung mga facilitators namin.

936
01:01:39,680 --> 01:01:42,870
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Nung recent Senate Committee hearing po,

937
01:01:42,870 --> 01:01:46,870
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: it was recognized that there is a lack of guidance counselors.

938
01:01:46,880 --> 01:01:49,120
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: So we work with DSWD,

939
01:01:49,120 --> 01:01:53,860
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: meron po silang programa na Tara-Usap,

940
01:01:53,860 --> 01:01:55,200
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: and may cash for work po iyan

941
01:01:55,200 --> 01:01:59,120
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: para sa mga volunteers na tutulong sa mental health peer support.

942
01:01:59,120 --> 01:02:05,960
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Chair, hindi po. I think it's not an accident. It's by design na magkasama sa DILG family ang PNP at ang NYC.

943
01:02:07,600 --> 01:02:13,500
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Nasusundan po ba natin kung nasaan yung incidents, nung mga nabanggit ko kanina ng report ng PNP?

944
01:02:13,500 --> 01:02:18,460
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At ano po ang ginagawa natin? Halimbawa po, if you have this caravan, kapag may report na ganito sa isang area,

945
01:02:18,680 --> 01:02:22,500
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: nasusundan po ba natin at natatapatan natin ng immediate response, Mr. Chair?

946
01:02:22,500 --> 01:02:28,060
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Yes, Mr. Chair, naglabas po kami ng mga statements sa mga nangyari.

947
01:02:28,060 --> 01:02:32,480
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: And limited po ang NYC sa pagpapadala ng support.

948
01:02:32,480 --> 01:02:37,460
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: So ang pinakamabilis na magagawa lang po namin is magpadala ng mga facilitators.

949
01:02:37,460 --> 01:02:45,420
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: And siguro I'll take this chance na rin po. Nag-propose po kami ng anti-bullying summit for next year na in-approve naman po ng DBM.

950
01:02:45,420 --> 01:02:51,440
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: So we hope to work with you, Mr. Chair, para gawin yung programa nito for next year. Salamat po.

951
01:02:52,020 --> 01:02:53,560
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Maraming salamat, Mr. Chair.

952
01:02:53,560 --> 01:02:55,860
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kasi po halimbawa dito sa report ng PNP,

953
01:02:55,860 --> 01:02:59,100
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: merong 12 alleged shooting threats, 4 stabbing incidents,

954
01:02:59,100 --> 01:03:03,240
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: 4 arrests for illegal possession of firearms, at dalawang death threats.

955
01:03:03,240 --> 01:03:09,580
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kung ma-map po natin kung nasaan ito, baka dapat dito rin yung tutok nung ating intervention when it comes to mental health services.

956
01:03:10,260 --> 01:03:14,680
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Mr. Chair, I would like to add as well that nag-partner po kami with META.

957
01:03:14,680 --> 01:03:18,240
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: And currently ongoing po yung META camps namin.

958
01:03:18,240 --> 01:03:22,920
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Tinuturuan po namin per province and select sites how to use the tools of META

959
01:03:22,920 --> 01:03:28,960
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: kasi currently po marami po daw nagre-report sa META ng mga bullying, so ginawan po kami ng

960
01:03:28,960 --> 01:03:34,140
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: direct line ng META na kung may magre-report po sa NYC, puwede po namin silang direct na tawagan.

961
01:03:34,140 --> 01:03:35,800
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: So iyon po yung ginagawa namin, Mr. Chair.

962
01:03:35,800 --> 01:03:37,020
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

963
01:03:37,020 --> 01:03:38,420
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: I agree with the good Secretary.

964
01:03:38,420 --> 01:03:41,720
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Malaki po yung papel din ng ating mga tahanan,

965
01:03:41,720 --> 01:03:48,620
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: kaya nga hindi lamang whole-of-government approach ang kailangan natin dito sa pagtugon sa karahasan sa ating mga eskwelahan,

966
01:03:48,620 --> 01:03:50,740
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: kung hindi whole-of-nation approach.

967
01:03:51,160 --> 01:03:53,880
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: And let me move on to an equally important issue.

968
01:03:54,040 --> 01:03:59,160
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Yung issue po ng ating mga mas bata kesa sa mga kabataang pinag-uusapan natin kanina.

969
01:03:59,380 --> 01:04:07,740
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sabi po ng EDCOM sa kanilang Early Childhood Dashboard, aabot sa 4,600 na barangay ang walang Child Development Center sa ating bansa.

970
01:04:08,020 --> 01:04:10,100
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ito po mga CDCs,

971
01:04:10,100 --> 01:04:13,280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: baka mas familiar po ang ating mga kababayan sa tawag na daycare centers.

972
01:04:13,560 --> 01:04:17,320
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ulitin ko po, 4,600 na barangay ang walang daycare centers.

973
01:04:17,840 --> 01:04:22,580
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ngayon ba lang po pinirmahan ang IRR ng Early Child Care and Development System Act?

974
01:04:22,820 --> 01:04:26,520
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sa tingin po ba natin sa DILG ay matutugunan na ang kakulangan?

975
01:04:26,640 --> 01:04:31,140
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sorry, matutugunan na ba ang kakulangan sa daycare centers because of this new law?

976
01:04:32,080 --> 01:04:36,180
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, the daycare centers are allotted in the budget of the barangay.

977
01:04:36,180 --> 01:04:37,940
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: It should be part of the barangay budget.

978
01:04:37,940 --> 01:04:48,580
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: If you look at the DILG budget, sir, 96% is either for MOOE or salaries.

979
01:04:48,960 --> 01:04:53,680
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So in terms of this, sir, for additional daycare centers, it is not

980
01:04:53,680 --> 01:04:56,470
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: the DILG's budget that is involved,

981
01:04:56,480 --> 01:05:02,640
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: but rather the DPWH, the province, and the other local government units that are involved.

982
01:05:02,640 --> 01:05:08,920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: And I can imagine, mahalaga po ang magiging papel ng ECCDC para i-facilitate po ito.

983
01:05:08,980 --> 01:05:13,100
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pero napansin ko po, isa yung ECCDC sa mayroong budget cuts this year.

984
01:05:14,160 --> 01:05:23,350
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, there are 124 million ang budget.

985
01:05:25,200 --> 01:05:30,480
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: A lot of this will go, sir, to the feeding program and capacity building for the children, sir.

986
01:05:31,060 --> 01:05:37,840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sige po. Baka mahalaga po na magkaroon ng convergence to be able to facilitate yung gap na ito between the DILG and the other concerned agencies.

987
01:05:37,840 --> 01:05:38,980
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: You're very cognizant of it, sir.

988
01:05:39,220 --> 01:05:40,620
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Thank you very much, Mr. Secretary.

989
01:05:42,340 --> 01:05:47,400
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Punta naman po ako doon sa usapin ng HIV, particularly among young people.

990
01:05:47,980 --> 01:05:50,200
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pasensya na po, medyo malapit talaga sa puso ko ito.

991
01:05:50,260 --> 01:05:53,820
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: This was my area of work when I was working in the NYC.

992
01:05:53,920 --> 01:05:59,480
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At nabalitaan po natin, ang NYC mayroong ginawang training program to capacitate the SK

993
01:05:59,480 --> 01:06:05,480
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: pagdating sa HIV-AIDS programming and budgeting in partnership with our friends from UNAIDS and HASH.

994
01:06:05,740 --> 01:06:08,660
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sa anong regions or provinces po natin na-implement yung programa?

995
01:06:09,180 --> 01:06:12,200
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Mr. Chair, nag-pilot po tayo dito sa Metro Manila.

996
01:06:12,300 --> 01:06:14,080
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Pero ang pinakasignificant po actually,

997
01:06:14,260 --> 01:06:18,520
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Mr. Chair, is yung participation natin sa Love, Laban Pride Parade.

998
01:06:18,740 --> 01:06:23,920
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: And this was the first time na nag-attend po ang National Youth Commission actually in 2025.

999
01:06:25,200 --> 01:06:33,480
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: And ito pong 2026, ito po ang pinakamalaking contribution ng gobyerno through the National Youth Commission sa ating LGBTQ Pride Parade.

1000
01:06:33,480 --> 01:06:43,620
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Nagkaroon po tayo ng almost half a million, Mr. Chair, attendees and a lot of them actually went to the booths na meron po tayong HIV tests.

1001
01:06:43,620 --> 01:06:47,100
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: So kailangan lang po namin, Mr. Chair, kunin yung mga numero

1002
01:06:47,100 --> 01:06:50,960
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: kung ilan talaga nagpa-test, then we can give it to you, Mr. Chair.

1003
01:06:51,500 --> 01:06:56,680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So sa NYC, halos Quezon City lang po yung Love Laban ito na pilot, tama po ba?

1004
01:06:56,800 --> 01:07:03,280
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Mr. Chair, actually ang Love Laban po nangyari po iyan in multiple locations at different times to celebrate the pride.

1005
01:07:03,280 --> 01:07:08,550
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: So ang count po sa Quezon City is around 300,000.

1006
01:07:08,560 --> 01:07:10,940
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: National po in different parts of the Philippines was 500,000.

1007
01:07:11,240 --> 01:07:16,260
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So ano po ang plano natin to be able to replicate this in other areas around the country?

1008
01:07:16,560 --> 01:07:22,260
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Mr. Chair, sa sobrang maganda na effect na binigay nito sa ating kabataan,

1009
01:07:22,800 --> 01:07:28,080
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: nag-commit po ang NYC for a Visayas and Mindanao leg for the Pride Parade.

1010
01:07:28,080 --> 01:07:33,460
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: However, wala pa po siya sa NEP namin. Meron lang po kaming 5 million for Manila.

1011
01:07:33,680 --> 01:07:40,740
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: But we are requesting sana po para magkaroon tayo ng Visayas at Mindanao leg, an additional 5 million per island-wide po.

1012
01:07:40,880 --> 01:07:41,840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So magkano po ang total?

1013
01:07:42,200 --> 01:07:45,900
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Total po is 15 million, Mr. Chair.

1014
01:07:45,900 --> 01:07:51,920
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Pero given the nature na binigyan po kami ng 8 million, we are requesting for additional 12 million po.

1015
01:07:51,960 --> 01:07:56,800
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Para kasama na po dito yung kababaihan, kasama na rin po dito yung adolescent sexual reproductive health.

1016
01:07:56,800 --> 01:07:58,680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Maraming salamat, Mr. Chair.

1017
01:07:58,680 --> 01:08:07,060
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: I cannot overemphasize how important yung intervention among young key population, YKP kung tawagin natin, sa HIV-AIDS programming ng bansa.

1018
01:08:07,060 --> 01:08:12,220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: And I think the most capable agency to do that would be the NYC in partnership with our SK.

1019
01:08:12,500 --> 01:08:19,860
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At dahil din po sa fiscal autonomy ng SK, talagang malaki ang puwedeng gawin at the community level ng ating mga youth leaders.

1020
01:08:19,860 --> 01:08:25,440
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Para tiyakin na ikakalat natin ang impormasyon, tamang impormasyon for responsible behavior.

1021
01:08:25,440 --> 01:08:30,420
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: at maging accessible ang mga services tulad ng testing at iba pa.

1022
01:08:30,540 --> 01:08:35,480
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At kasama po dito, yung pagbawas ng stigma and discrimination pagdating sa HIV and AIDS.

1023
01:08:35,680 --> 01:08:37,800
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Last questions na lang po.

1024
01:08:39,000 --> 01:08:41,840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Alam natin kung gaano kahalaga ang ating mga barangay health workers,

1025
01:08:41,960 --> 01:08:44,400
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: speaking of frontliners at the community level,

1026
01:08:44,760 --> 01:08:47,340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: pero sana mas alam po natin ang pinagdadaanan nila.

1027
01:08:47,520 --> 01:08:48,540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Hindi ko na po ulitin iyan.

1028
01:08:48,560 --> 01:08:52,880
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Walang sahod, sa bulsang kinukuha ang pamasahe ng pasyente, et cetera.

1029
01:08:53,380 --> 01:08:55,200
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: May plano po ba ang DILG

1030
01:08:55,200 --> 01:09:01,000
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: na suportahan ang transportation costs ng ating mga BHW at i-cover ang gamot ng kanilang mga pasyente?

1031
01:09:02,360 --> 01:09:11,000
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Again, sir, the DILG is supervisory over the LGUs who handle the BHWs.

1032
01:09:11,160 --> 01:09:15,360
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: As of current, sir, the BHWs are listed down by the barangay captains, passed on to the municipalities,

1033
01:09:15,420 --> 01:09:22,820
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and then given allowance by the governors and the other LCEs.

1034
01:09:22,820 --> 01:09:28,840
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So as far as that is concerned, it is not in our budget but we have supervisory authority over it.

1035
01:09:29,480 --> 01:09:30,080
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Perci,

1036
01:09:30,770 --> 01:09:31,420
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Mr. Chair,

1037
01:09:31,580 --> 01:09:32,580
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Mr. Chair,

1038
01:09:39,260 --> 01:09:39,840
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Interjection.

1039
01:09:40,450 --> 01:09:41,320
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: We do not allow.

1040
01:09:41,420 --> 01:09:47,300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Can we let Kong Perci finish his interpellation?

1041
01:09:47,680 --> 01:09:48,640
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Sorry, Kong Jay.

1042
01:09:50,220 --> 01:09:55,680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Napakahalaga po kasi ng papel ng ating mga BHWs and I'm sure that as former governor, you really appreciate that.

1043
01:09:55,820 --> 01:10:02,580
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: And we would appreciate interventions from the DILG to be able to facilitate this when it comes to the implementation at the LGU level.

1044
01:10:02,580 --> 01:10:10,660
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So, baka po, a set of guidelines, a set of recommendations to the LGU will be very helpful in this area, Mr. Secretary.

1045
01:10:11,120 --> 01:10:12,000
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Well taken, sir.

1046
01:10:12,120 --> 01:10:12,700
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We will do so.

1047
01:10:13,040 --> 01:10:15,220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Thank you very much, Mr. Chairman. Maraming salamat po.

1048
01:10:15,320 --> 01:10:16,260
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you, Kong Perci.

1049
01:10:16,880 --> 01:10:22,320
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Just to remind everyone, our colleagues, we do not allow any interjection.

1050
01:10:23,560 --> 01:10:24,100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Okay.

1051
01:10:24,100 --> 01:10:27,280
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And this is about our rules.

1052
01:10:27,980 --> 01:10:30,920
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Okay, so, sorry, Congressman Jay Vergara.

1053
01:10:30,920 --> 01:10:36,200
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Next to interpolate, Congressman Bong Teves, you have one minute.

1054
01:10:36,200 --> 01:10:37,420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: The good one.

1055
01:10:40,280 --> 01:10:41,960
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Bong Teves, the good one.

1056
01:10:47,440 --> 01:10:48,440
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Mr. Chair,

1057
01:10:49,600 --> 01:11:02,980
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: The DILG family, of course, the number one agency na pinagtitiwalaan ng sambayan ng Pilipino, Philippine National Police, headed by our PNP chief

1058
01:11:02,980 --> 01:11:04,400
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Police General Nartatez,

1059
01:11:04,400 --> 01:11:12,580
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: kasama ang masipag na komisyoner ng NAPOLCOM, Commissioner Vicente Calinisan,

1060
01:11:12,580 --> 01:11:18,500
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: and of course, the DOJ Secretary,

1061
01:11:18,500 --> 01:11:31,220
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: ang ating kumpare, ating matagal nang kaibigan, energetic and handsome Secretary, Secretary Boying Remulla.

1062
01:11:33,620 --> 01:11:36,480
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Good morning po sa inyo lahat.

1063
01:11:39,340 --> 01:11:47,080
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Mr. Chair, alam naman natin na matagal nang napapabayaan ang Bureau of Fire Protection

1064
01:11:47,080 --> 01:11:53,000
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: tulad ng sinabi po kanina ng ating kasama, si Congressman Valeriano.

1065
01:11:53,000 --> 01:11:59,000
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Ang kanila pong mandato ay bukod sa umapula ng sunog,

1066
01:11:59,000 --> 01:12:02,800
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: ay mag-responde sa natural at man-made disasters.

1067
01:12:04,420 --> 01:12:06,840
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Lagi natin silang nakikita sa kalsada,

1068
01:12:06,880 --> 01:12:08,360
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: tuwing may kalamidad,

1069
01:12:08,780 --> 01:12:11,360
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: baha, lindol, sunog,

1070
01:12:11,360 --> 01:12:13,080
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: lagi silang andiyan.

1071
01:12:14,600 --> 01:12:15,800
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Mr. Chair,

