Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: bill nila?

2785
02:44:50,940 --> 02:44:56,240
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Bago sila mabigyan ng award na fiscal management, parang mayroong ganon.

2786
02:44:56,280 --> 02:45:01,680
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi mayroong kayong maraming nabigyan ng Seal of fiscal management,

2787
