2792
02:45:36,200 --> 02:45:39,440
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Maraming maraming salamat talaga, Mr. Secretary.

2793
02:45:39,500 --> 02:45:47,840
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: at ang mga electric cooperative ay may utang na loob sa DILG sa pag-upo mo na na-issue, na-implement namin

2794
02:45:47,840 --> 02:45:49,920
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: at least apat na lang na probinsya.

2795
02:45:50,280 --> 02:45:52,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: That's all, Mr. Chair. Maraming salamat.

2796
02:45:52,640 --> 02:45:53,560
