2804
02:46:20,160 --> 02:46:21,180
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, ma'am.

2805
02:46:22,060 --> 02:46:25,680
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Sana we will continue to feel yung bagong Pilipinas.

2806
02:46:25,680 --> 02:46:32,440
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And I would like to congratulate, of course, Secretary, for your unified 9-1-1 program.

2807
02:46:32,800 --> 02:46:33,240
