03:22:30,550 --> 03:22:35,320
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: A total amount of 19,480,000,000.

3678
03:22:36,180 --> 03:22:42,880
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Sa NEP, ang lumabas for 2027, naging 5 million.

3679
03:22:44,160 --> 03:22:48,420
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Wala naman ng question dyan because it's under the DILG's

3680
03:22:48,420 --> 03:22:49,760
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: jurisdiction.

3681
03:22:50,120 --> 03:22:55,440
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Total amount is 9,740,000,000.

3682
03:22:55,440 --> 03:22:57,920
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Ano ka lang, Mr. Secretary?

3683
03:22:57,920 --> 03:23:05,040
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Because yung one example is my district, lone district, Butuan City.

3684
03:23:05,040 --> 03:23:07,320
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Highly urbanized.

3685
03:23:07,320 --> 03:23:14,420
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: But when you say highly urbanized, it doesn't mean nawala kaming rural baranggays.

3686
03:23:14,420 --> 03:23:15,340
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: No?

3687
03:23:14,420 --> 03:23:17,480
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Just last month.

3688
03:23:17,480 --> 03:23:24,440
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Masok ako, 15 rural baranggays na sa mga schools.

3689
03:23:24,440 --> 03:23:27,320
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Chineck ko ano mga kailangan nila.

3690
03:23:27,460 --> 03:23:29,080
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: A lot of them, classrooms.

3691
03:23:29,080 --> 03:23:29,160
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: No?

3692
03:23:30,320 --> 03:23:37,220
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Now, under this program sa SBDP, isa sa mga menu niya is classroom.

3693
03:23:37,900 --> 03:23:43,980
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Now, if we base it on 5 million,

3694
03:23:43,980 --> 03:23:49,640
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Ang classroom ngayon, Mr. Secretary, is 3 to 3.5 million.

3695
03:23:49,760 --> 03:23:50,500
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Kung baga, bitin.

3696
03:23:50,800 --> 03:23:51,440
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Di ba?

3697
03:23:52,640 --> 03:24:02,340
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Ang isa pang iba pang ano nito is health center, water, which is very important sa mga rural barangays.

3698
03:24:04,820 --> 03:24:05,380
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Electrification.

3699
03:24:05,720 --> 03:24:07,720
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: In fact, ako, I've been trying hard.

3700
03:24:08,660 --> 03:24:11,620
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Gusto ko mag-serve sa mga rural baranggays.

3701
03:24:12,120 --> 03:24:12,680
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Tapakadilim.

3702
03:24:13,900 --> 03:24:17,320
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Gusto ko magbigay ng streetlights na

3703
03:24:17,320 --> 03:24:17,680
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Gusto ko mag-serve sa mga rural baranggays.

3704
03:24:17,320 --> 03:24:19,480
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: solar para hindi sila mabigatan.

3705
03:24:19,660 --> 03:24:25,420
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Dahil kung magbibigay ka ng may kriyente, mabigat sa isang rural baranggay para magbayad.

3706
03:24:26,020 --> 03:24:30,420
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Now, with 5 million alone, medyo mahirap ang classroom.

3707
03:24:31,440 --> 03:24:34,660
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Ako lang, Mr. Secretary, please continue smiling.

3708
03:24:37,800 --> 03:24:38,980
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Appeal lang yung akin.

3709
03:24:39,200 --> 03:24:41,440
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Baka pwede maging 7 million.

3710
03:24:41,440 --> 03:24:44,880
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: I mean, yeah, 7 million instead of 10 million.

3711
03:24:45,040 --> 03:24:46,540
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Okay, babaan natin.

3712
03:24:46,540 --> 03:24:48,700
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: But, ang binigay 5 million.

3713
03:24:48,800 --> 03:24:53,580
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Baka naman, appeal lang pwedeng maging 7 para maging dalawang classroom.

3714
03:24:53,940 --> 03:24:58,200
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, if it is possible for Congress to increase it, then we will welcome it.

3715
03:24:58,260 --> 03:24:59,540
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We actually asked for 10 million.

3716
03:25:00,020 --> 03:25:01,420
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: BBM only allowed 5.

3717
03:25:01,900 --> 03:25:06,880
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, it is up to this August Chamber to adjust it to what it sees fit.

3718
03:25:07,040 --> 03:25:10,080
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But, we would most certainly welcome if it is increased to 7 million.

3719
03:25:12,500 --> 03:25:16,080
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Yan, may iniisip din kaming makapasok din dito, makatulong.

3720
03:25:16,080 --> 03:25:17,780
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Kasi, very important.

3721
03:25:17,780 --> 03:25:20,480
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: I agree.

3722
03:25:20,480 --> 03:25:23,200
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: So, this is not only for me, it is for the whole Philippines, mga barangay.

3723
03:25:25,280 --> 03:25:29,060
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: In Cavite alone, sir, we have a shortage of 2,000 classrooms.

3724
03:25:30,080 --> 03:25:33,270
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, I totally understand what your predicament is.

3725
03:25:33,270 --> 03:25:34,550
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: That's all, Mr. Secretary.

3726
03:25:34,560 --> 03:25:35,040
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Thank you very much, sir.

3727
03:25:35,040 --> 03:25:35,360
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Thank you.

3728
03:25:38,400 --> 03:25:39,200
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you.

3729
03:25:39,200 --> 03:25:40,400
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you, Kong Jo. Are you done?

3730
03:25:40,400 --> 03:25:40,960
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you very much.

3731
03:25:41,160 --> 03:25:42,560
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: May meron pa ba?

3732
03:25:43,380 --> 03:25:44,920
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: One hour, 40 minutes.

3733
03:25:45,160 --> 03:25:46,840
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yeah, may one hour and forty minutes.

3734
03:25:47,120 --> 03:25:47,660
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Pabreak ko na lang sa Secretary.

3735
03:25:48,020 --> 03:25:48,900
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Makapahinga muna eh.

3736
03:25:48,900 --> 03:25:49,800
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Okay lang, okay lang.

3737
03:25:48,940 --> 03:25:50,700
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you.

3738
03:25:50,760 --> 03:25:51,760
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you, Cong Joboy.

3739
03:25:51,820 --> 03:25:55,180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Next, to interpellate, we have Congressman Romualdo.

3740
03:25:55,440 --> 03:25:56,100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Is he around?

3741
03:25:56,460 --> 03:25:56,820
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Wala.

3742
03:25:57,560 --> 03:25:59,180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Congresswoman Florabel Yatco.

3743
03:26:00,560 --> 03:26:01,020
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Wala.

3744
03:26:01,020 --> 03:26:03,480
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Next, pinakamaganda sa Kongreso.

3745
03:26:03,480 --> 03:26:07,020
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Isa sa pinakamaganda sa Kongreso, Congresswoman Mica Gonzales.

3746
03:26:08,580 --> 03:26:09,700
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Ma'am, you have the floor.

3747
03:26:13,980 --> 03:26:16,000
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Akala kong vice-acknowledgement.

3748
03:26:16,000 --> 03:26:17,060
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Ako na pala.

3749
03:26:17,060 --> 03:26:18,820
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Thank you very much, Mr. Chair.

3750
03:26:20,080 --> 03:26:24,480
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Good afternoon po to the DILG family and all the attached agencies.

3751
03:26:24,480 --> 03:26:45,380
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: I just have a question, quick question on the, I think this was open during the first few interpellators but I want to, yeah, but I want to ask whether, because we've observed po no, na for the past few months,

3752
03:26:45,720 --> 03:26:52,900
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: mga bata po ang involved na sa mga nangyayari sa ating skwela.

3753
03:26:52,900 --> 03:26:56,100
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: And napansin ko lang din po, wala po.

3754
03:26:56,200 --> 03:27:10,560
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Wala po ba kayang parang syndicate sa mga bata na nagre-recruit sila para to encourage or to, you know, to encourage gun violence or violence in general?

3755
03:27:10,560 --> 03:27:14,460
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Kasi hindi lang po isa, dalawang beses yung mga ganyang cases.

3756
03:27:14,660 --> 03:27:15,480
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Ang dami na po.

3757
03:27:15,560 --> 03:27:25,600
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: So I was just wondering whether the PNP or the DILG or the other attached agencies, meron na po ba tayong nakita, naimbestigahan na meron po ganong klaseng recruitment?

3758
03:27:25,600 --> 03:27:27,420
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: sa ating mga kabataan?

3759
03:27:27,900 --> 03:27:30,000
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: There are three parts to this, ma'am.

3760
03:27:30,100 --> 03:27:38,760
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: One is the, there are parts of the crimes which we cannot discuss because it will encourage copycat crimes.

3761
03:27:40,560 --> 03:27:48,340
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So we cannot reveal everything but if there is an executive session, I can reveal the details of the crime.

3762
03:27:48,460 --> 03:27:57,480
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So what we try to discourage are copycat crimes that they get, that the perpetrators become idolized by those.

3763
03:27:58,000 --> 03:28:15,040
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Number two, sir ma'am, is the game, the first person shooter Roblox which has a conversation box beside it, which in the chat box which encourages the participants to commit actual violence.

3764
03:28:15,040 --> 03:28:26,160
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: That's why I've been lobbying for it to be banned here in the Philippines because it has the common occurrence in Tacloban and Zamboanga is both players, both actors were,

3765
03:28:26,160 --> 03:28:31,360
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and heavily influenced by the game Roblox.

3766
03:28:31,360 --> 03:28:44,600
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: The last part, ma'am, is we are trying our best to enforce it by creating police presence outside the classrooms, outside the school sites, and inside with the barangay tanods.

3767
03:28:46,860 --> 03:28:48,620
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

3768
03:28:48,780 --> 03:28:55,780
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Last question, with regards to the presence of the police in the school vicinity, hanggang kailan po natin to implement?

3769
03:28:55,900 --> 03:28:57,120
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Is it a permanent thing?

3770
03:28:57,360 --> 03:29:00,800
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: It's a policy, ma'am. It's a policy already.

3771
03:29:01,200 --> 03:29:11,960
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Thank you, Mr. Chair. That's all. I think yung po sinasabi ni ni Secretary na if there's an executive session, we can. But hopefully, after budget na po, we should go ahead with the budget.

3772
03:29:12,000 --> 03:29:14,000
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Thank you, Mr. Chair. That's all. Thank you po.

3773
03:29:14,080 --> 03:29:14,580
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you very much.

3774
03:29:15,280 --> 03:29:17,340
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you, Kong Mika.

3775
03:29:17,860 --> 03:29:20,820
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Next to interpolate, we have Congressman Jay Vergara.

3776
03:29:23,200 --> 03:29:23,640
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Opo.

3777
03:29:25,120 --> 03:29:28,140
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Pag pinalampas ko po ito, maghihintay ka ng tapos sila.

3778
03:29:30,080 --> 03:29:33,100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Huli ka na po. Magiging huli ka.

3779
03:29:36,160 --> 03:29:38,280
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, you have five minutes.

3780
03:29:40,680 --> 03:29:42,720
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

3781
03:29:44,960 --> 03:29:48,380
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Ang malaking kong, ay, magandang maga po, Sekretaryo.

3782
03:29:48,580 --> 03:29:49,220
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

3783
03:29:49,340 --> 03:29:57,140
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Maraming salamat po sa inyo. Sa inyo pong sulad na nakarating po sa amin.

3784
03:29:57,380 --> 03:29:58,040
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

3785
03:29:58,120 --> 03:30:18,460
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: At yung Cabanatuan City po kasi, tatong beses na naging best of the best, best of the best city police station sa iba't ibang administrasyon.

3786
03:30:18,460 --> 03:30:19,740
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

3787
03:30:21,260 --> 03:30:33,600
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Bumibili po kami ng motorsiklo. Nung araw, repeater system para sa mga police.

3788
03:30:33,600 --> 03:30:42,000
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: At kami po ay every, sa 28 taong ko po na paglilingkod,

3789
03:30:42,000 --> 03:30:46,000
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: nakabili po kami.

3790
03:30:46,000 --> 03:30:54,400
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Parate ng minimum of 12 noong ako yung mag-umpisa.

3791
03:30:55,660 --> 03:31:01,000
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Tapos, pwera po yung motorsiklo, pwera yung bisikleta.

3792
03:31:01,620 --> 03:31:06,300
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Tapos, ito po Toyota na.

3793
03:31:06,300 --> 03:31:11,020
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Tapos, sumunod po ng Toyota ay Nissan Patrol.

3794
03:31:11,020 --> 03:31:14,500
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Ngayon po, June na naman po kami bumili.

3795
03:31:17,820 --> 03:31:20,800
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Bilang tulong po sa gobyerno nasyonal,

3796
03:31:23,300 --> 03:31:27,700
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Kami po ay nakaschedule na bumili rin ulit.

3797
03:31:27,700 --> 03:31:31,640
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Ngunit, ang Cabanatuan po kasi ay

3798
03:31:31,640 --> 03:31:38,800
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: ay merong 300, ayon sa PSA, 347,700 plus

3799
03:31:38,800 --> 03:31:45,160
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: ang aming night time population.

3800
03:31:45,680 --> 03:31:48,500
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Ngunit ang Cabanatuan po ay

3801
03:31:48,500 --> 03:31:58,500
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: merong labing-anim na mall kasama ang dalawang SM, SNR.

3802
03:31:58,500 --> 03:32:02,200
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Ang Landers po ay magtatayo ngayon.

3803
03:32:02,200 --> 03:32:06,000
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Kaya ang aming pong, ang banko po namin, 96.

3804
03:32:06,000 --> 03:32:10,000
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: At may banko sentral kami.

3805
03:32:10,000 --> 03:32:14,000
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Ngayon ho, may nakagiyak po kami yung pondo

3806
03:32:14,000 --> 03:32:18,000
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: na bumili ng 2,400 at 8 CCTV.

3807
03:32:18,000 --> 03:32:26,300
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Kaya, bumili ng 2,408 CCTV.

3808
03:32:28,500 --> 03:32:32,200
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: At saka na, i-geotag na namin,

3809
03:32:32,200 --> 03:32:36,740
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: na iayos na po namin sa bawat posting paglalagyan.

3810
03:32:38,260 --> 03:32:40,200
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: At kami po ay makakara,

3811
03:32:40,200 --> 03:32:47,000
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: we will be a recipient of donation

3812
03:32:47,000 --> 03:32:49,780
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: for solar lamps.

3813
03:32:51,240 --> 03:32:53,200
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: So, ang akin po,

3814
03:32:53,200 --> 03:32:58,200
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: buhat po nung ako'y naging mayor noong 1998,

3815
