Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: So, hirap.

3817
03:33:11,660 --> 03:33:13,600
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I get your point, sir.

3818
03:33:13,600 --> 03:33:17,000
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, I think in the next deployment,

3819
03:33:17,000 --> 03:33:19,200
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: in the next recruitment cycle,

3820
03:33:19,200 --> 03:33:22,280
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: we will make sure to augment your police force, sir.

3821
03:33:22,320 --> 03:33:26,680
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But overall, sir, the country is really deficient in policemen.

3822
03:33:26,980 --> 03:33:30,000
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But in your case, sir, as a fast-growing urban center,

3823
03:33:30,000 --> 03:33:32,400
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: we will make sure that we will augment your police force.

3824
03:33:33,500 --> 03:33:35,040
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Yes, Mr. Secretary.

3825
03:33:35,420 --> 03:33:38,500
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, just to give you an example,

3826
