DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: the province of Cavite has a population of 5.5 million,

3827
03:33:41,920 --> 03:33:44,260
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: but we only have 2,000 policemen.

3828
03:33:44,860 --> 03:33:48,220
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, we suffer the same problems all around.

3829
03:33:49,420 --> 03:33:52,620
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But we will make sure to augment your capacity, sir.

3830
03:33:52,780 --> 03:33:54,900
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: So, ang nangyayari po kasi,

3831
03:33:56,540 --> 03:33:59,300
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: kumisan, ang ginagawa nalang po namin

3832
03:33:59,300 --> 03:34:03,320
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: bilang pakisama sa PNP province,

3833
03:34:03,320 --> 03:34:07,800
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: ay nahihiram po yung aming sasakyan.

3834
03:34:07,980 --> 03:34:08,400
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Tama, sir.

3835
03:34:08,480 --> 03:34:11,240
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Hanggang huro sa region.

3836
03:34:11,240 --> 03:34:11,920
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Tama, sir.

3837
03:34:11,920 --> 03:34:20,240
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Pagka mga rescue vehicle po namin ay sapo at ganun po ang nangyayari.

3838
03:34:20,240 --> 03:34:21,580
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Tama, sir.

3839
03:34:21,580 --> 03:34:21,900
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: At, ah...

3840
03:34:21,580 --> 03:34:23,420
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Ganun po ang nangyayari.

3841
03:34:21,580 --> 03:34:22,020
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Okay, sir.

3842
03:34:21,580 --> 03:34:22,020
