7231
06:32:25,680 --> 06:32:30,660
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: I do believe that PAGASA is also doing its best to provide most accurate information

7232
06:32:30,660 --> 06:32:33,540
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: to all local governments and to all our citizens.

7233
06:32:33,960 --> 06:32:35,100
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Yes, thank you.

7234
06:32:38,580 --> 06:32:43,120
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Sa mga climate change threatened and forever flooded municipalities,

7235
06:32:44,140 --> 06:32:50,060
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: first of all, I would like to commend the PNP sa kanila pong tulong sa amin sa 4th District of Pampanga.

7236
06:32:50,400 --> 06:32:55,300
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Napakasipag po nila and they were with us last year and this year.

7237
06:32:55,580 --> 06:33:00,200
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And sila po nagbibigay ng libring sakay so gusto ko po silang pasalamatan.

7238
06:33:00,740 --> 06:33:06,000
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Now, the second question sa amin, I would also like to thank the BFP.

7239
06:33:06,620 --> 06:33:07,620
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Meron din po silang Rinescu.

7240
06:33:11,120 --> 06:33:18,800
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, my question is, pwede po ba natin silang i-capacitate at i-train?

7241
06:33:19,060 --> 06:33:23,140
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: At saka nagahanap po talaga sila ng mga gamit for water rescue.

7242
06:33:23,380 --> 06:33:31,100
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Can we identify po specific flooded areas like the entire Pampanga or maybe the 4th District of Pampanga?

7243
06:33:31,320 --> 06:33:33,560
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Kasi wala man po kami mga boats eh.

7244
06:33:34,680 --> 06:33:36,380
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Konting-konti lang po talaga.

7245
06:33:36,380 --> 06:33:38,300
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And I think that we should...

7246
06:33:38,300 --> 06:33:41,100
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Identify areas that need to be rescued po.

7247
06:33:41,940 --> 06:33:43,240
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Pwede po ba yun?

7248
06:33:43,340 --> 06:33:49,400
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And can you share with us what you are doing po for water rescue, lalo na po sa flooded areas?

7249
06:33:50,220 --> 06:33:51,540
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Ma'am, good afternoon po.

7250
06:33:52,820 --> 06:33:58,800
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Yung Bureau for Protection plays a very vital role pagdating po sa HIDR, especially on flooding.

7251
06:33:58,880 --> 06:34:02,200
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Yung nakikita niyo po na nakatancherate are all BFP.

7252
06:34:02,640 --> 06:34:07,900
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Ang ginagawa po ng BFP ngayon, ma'am, continuous po yung capacity building po ng mga local disaster restaurants.

7253
06:34:08,260 --> 06:34:11,100
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: At yung management office ng mga LGUs nila.

7254
06:34:12,680 --> 06:34:17,760
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Isa po yan, ma'am, sa nakasama po sa listahan na mga bibiliin po ng BFP.

7255
06:34:17,760 --> 06:34:22,660
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Pagdating po sa HIDR, kasama na po yung mga watercraft natin na magagamit automatically.

7256
06:34:22,980 --> 06:34:24,480
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: That includes also the life vest.

7257
06:34:24,940 --> 06:34:30,420
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: So hopefully po, madagdagan lang po yung pondo ng BFP para po mabiliin natin yung ating kailangan po.

7258
06:34:31,340 --> 06:34:33,580
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Rest assured, susuportahan ko po yan.

7259
06:34:33,800 --> 06:34:37,960
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And is it possible po that we would give the boats?

7260
06:34:38,440 --> 06:34:42,660
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Mga gamit po sa mga places na talagang alam po natin na binabaha?

7261
06:34:43,280 --> 06:34:48,980
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Ma'am, meron na po kaming identified mga localities na constantly po, maliit lang na ulan, binabaha kagad.

7262
06:34:50,440 --> 06:34:53,120
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Like yung mga nandun po sa Project NOAA, for example?

7263
06:34:53,720 --> 06:34:54,220
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Yes, ma'am.

7264
06:34:54,880 --> 06:34:58,860
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Pagka po, nadagdagan lang po yung pondo at mabibili po yung mga gamit namin,

7265
06:34:58,900 --> 06:35:04,520
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: that will be distributed geographically kung ano po yung needs ng mga local fire stations natin.

7266
06:35:05,540 --> 06:35:08,000
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Kasi po sa amin, umaagos talaga yung tubig.

7267
06:35:08,000 --> 06:35:10,800
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And somebody drowned actually in front of me.

7268
06:35:10,920 --> 06:35:13,140
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: At talagang kulang po yung gamit nila.

7269
06:35:13,260 --> 06:35:16,480
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, if you could support us po, we would be very grateful.

7270
06:35:17,340 --> 06:35:23,800
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Rest assured, ma'am, that we will do our best to help in the capacity building po ng mga local disaster reduction management office po natin,

7271
06:35:23,820 --> 06:35:25,240
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: yung mga parang gay disaster po.

7272
06:35:25,300 --> 06:35:27,540
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Constant naman po yung mga trainings namin sa kanila.

7273
06:35:27,540 --> 06:35:32,520
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: And hopefully in the future, ma-acquire po namin yung mga necessary equipments

7274
06:35:32,520 --> 06:35:38,000
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: and that will be placed doon po sa mga localities na talaga po tinatamaan po, baha or whatever.

7275
06:35:39,200 --> 06:35:40,940
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Kahit o hydromet hazards na meron po sila.

7276
06:35:40,940 --> 06:35:43,200
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Sige po. And we look forward to that.

7277
06:35:43,360 --> 06:35:46,000
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Sana po our PNPG would look into that also.

7278
06:35:46,000 --> 06:35:46,280
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Thank you.

7279
06:35:46,360 --> 06:35:53,080
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, after climate change po, my next question is regarding po yung

7280
06:35:53,080 --> 06:35:59,720
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: alam na po natin na talagang laganap na po ang mga threats sa bawat school po.

7281
06:35:59,720 --> 06:36:06,340
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: At araw-araw daw yung mga PNP nandun na po sa bawat school checking up on threats.

7282
06:36:06,740 --> 06:36:08,060
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, my question is,

7283
06:36:08,220 --> 06:36:14,140
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Paano po, parang nagkaroon po ng access sa mga barel ang mga bata?

7284
06:36:14,940 --> 06:36:20,720
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And I believe these are registered firearms given to licensed personnel.

7285
06:36:21,240 --> 06:36:27,780
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Like yung isa po, yung tita niya was a nurse, a lawyer, and a policeman, a policewoman.

7286
06:36:28,080 --> 06:36:30,000
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And the other one po, yung daddy niya po, customs.

7287
06:36:30,440 --> 06:36:32,020
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: How are you training po?

7288
06:36:32,700 --> 06:36:36,260
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Parang hindi po unregistered eh. Registered pa po yung mga firearms.

7289
06:36:36,640 --> 06:36:37,900
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Tama po ba ako doon?

7290
06:36:38,640 --> 06:36:40,240
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you for the last question.

7291
06:36:46,300 --> 06:36:47,100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Kindly answer.

7292
06:36:47,520 --> 06:36:49,080
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Your Honor, Mr. Chair.

7293
06:36:50,640 --> 06:37:05,280
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Those recovered firearms that were used in June 16 as well as in Zamboanga are all registered firearms except for the other one.

7294
06:37:05,280 --> 06:37:12,540
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: So, the Philippine National Police, of course, in coordination with other law enforcement units,

7295
06:37:12,540 --> 06:37:13,900
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: and as well,

7296
06:37:13,900 --> 06:37:17,980
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: as a unit responsible for regulating these firearms.

7297
06:37:18,180 --> 06:37:20,640
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Ginagawa po ng paraan with regards to several policies.

7298
06:37:21,120 --> 06:37:30,580
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: As to when we say these are within the reach of children, of course, or minor,

7299
06:37:30,780 --> 06:37:32,560
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: of course, nandun na yung indication.

7300
06:37:32,780 --> 06:37:37,840
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: But that's why we have prepared cases against these personalities

7301
06:37:37,840 --> 06:37:40,900
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: who are supposed to be the custodian of these firearms.

7302
06:37:41,200 --> 06:37:43,720
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: And one of...

7303
06:37:43,720 --> 06:37:55,840
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: The recommendation was, of course, the enactment of law such that maripil yung naging bailable ang ating violation of firearms,

7304
06:37:56,380 --> 06:37:58,020
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: illegal possession of firearms.

7305
06:37:58,240 --> 06:38:07,000
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: We are recommending that a higher penalty be imposed for those in possession of unlicensed firearms.

7306
06:38:07,500 --> 06:38:13,300
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Especially so that unlicensed firearms are being used in the commission of crime.

7307
06:38:13,300 --> 06:38:22,380
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: About 98% of the cases involving firearms are unlicensed firearms.

7308
06:38:22,680 --> 06:38:24,040
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Mr. Chair, Your Honor.

7309
06:38:28,300 --> 06:38:34,360
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And lastly, ano po yung maging role po ng barangay Tanots and the barangay regarding this?

7310
06:38:35,780 --> 06:38:38,800
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Ito pong mga nagiging violence in schools.

7311
06:38:42,360 --> 06:38:44,880
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Just like the police.

7312
06:38:44,880 --> 06:38:46,720
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: At may role po ba sila?

7313
06:38:47,160 --> 06:38:49,320
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Mr. Chair and Your Honor.

7314
06:38:49,500 --> 06:38:55,960
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Ang alam naman natin ng peace and order ay shared responsibility of the community and the...

7315
06:38:56,920 --> 06:38:58,640
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Kasi po, sir, sorry po.

7316
06:38:58,640 --> 06:39:01,240
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Limited lang po ang polis sa isang munisipyo eh.

7317
06:39:01,280 --> 06:39:04,160
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And they cannot be patrolling all the elementary schools.

7318
06:39:04,160 --> 06:39:09,680
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Though ako po as a parent, bahala na po yung ibang crimes, basta okay lang po yung mga kids.

7319
06:39:10,080 --> 06:39:11,920
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Pero again, that is not realistic.

7320
06:39:12,440 --> 06:39:14,400
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Pero kung tatangin niyo po, gusto ko yun.

7321
06:39:14,680 --> 06:39:15,340
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Yes, ma'am.

7322
06:39:15,340 --> 06:39:15,600
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes.

7323
06:39:15,700 --> 06:39:17,020
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Mr. Chair, Your Honor.

7324
06:39:17,280 --> 06:39:18,180
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Actually, there are...

7325
06:39:18,180 --> 06:39:20,800
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: 42,000 barangays nationwide.

7326
06:39:21,840 --> 06:39:27,080
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Kung pibilangin na lang natin ang number of schools, there are, of course, more than 42,000.

7327
06:39:31,560 --> 06:39:32,240
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: 42,000 schools.

7328
06:39:32,660 --> 06:39:38,820
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: So, let's say it's about 56,000 schools nationwide, including those private schools.

7329
06:39:39,420 --> 06:39:47,700
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: So, it is a must that we multiply each other, especially in negating the occurrence of crime

7330
06:39:47,700 --> 06:39:49,360
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: and maintaining peace and order.

7331
06:39:49,620 --> 06:39:55,640
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: The best po dyan is the police, other law enforcement agencies working together with the community

7332
06:39:55,640 --> 06:40:02,800
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: para po may capacitate at madinay natin by police presence or presence of our...

7333
06:40:02,800 --> 06:40:08,180
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: presence of this police in the community, especially in the school.

7334
06:40:08,180 --> 06:40:19,100
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: And if we have 230,000 and then say another times 3, 42,000 times 7 of barangay,

7335
06:40:19,100 --> 06:40:23,960
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: parangay, tanods, napakarami nun.

7336
06:40:24,100 --> 06:40:28,440
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: But it is not the efficient way of maintaining peace and order.

7337
06:40:30,160 --> 06:40:30,880
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Yes.

7338
06:40:30,880 --> 06:40:32,100
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Teamwork na lang.

7339
06:40:33,940 --> 06:40:39,160
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Sila muna yung una, tapos pag kayo na po yung re-rescue sa kanila.

7340
06:40:39,960 --> 06:40:41,120
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Mr. Chair, Your Honor.

7341
06:40:41,260 --> 06:40:41,360
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: through,

7342
06:40:41,360 --> 06:40:43,760
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: We have five statistics of...

7343
06:40:45,200 --> 06:40:48,120
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: We are sitting together, engaging each other, and...

7344
06:40:49,200 --> 06:40:52,080
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: making sure that we have our security plan for that.

7345
06:40:55,620 --> 06:41:01,500
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: May mga data po ba kayo regarding crime, kung ina niyong pinatay, kanila, or...

7346
06:41:01,500 --> 06:41:02,660
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Actions going down.

7347
06:41:03,660 --> 06:41:05,140
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Napakagaling po ng polis natin.

7348
06:41:05,180 --> 06:41:08,020
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Under the leadership of General Atates.

7349
06:41:09,040 --> 06:41:11,280
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Meron po ba kayong crime statistics?

7350
06:41:11,280 --> 06:41:12,400
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Like, pwede naman po...

7351
06:41:12,060 --> 06:41:13,980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes. Can you submit the...

7352
06:41:14,260 --> 06:41:16,280
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Yes, I'm actually curious lang po.

7353
06:41:17,120 --> 06:41:17,860
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: To this committee?

7354
06:41:17,860 --> 06:41:18,720
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Sir, yes.

7355
06:41:19,460 --> 06:41:20,980
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: I'm hoping pababa po.

7356
06:41:22,180 --> 06:41:23,080
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Actually, it is.

7357
06:41:23,660 --> 06:41:26,960
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Sir Chair, we'll be submitting the data.

7358
06:41:27,200 --> 06:41:30,120
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: But as far as I can remember,

7359
06:41:30,880 --> 06:41:36,380
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: when we implemented and or launched our Safer Cities,

7360
06:41:36,580 --> 06:41:41,260
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: lalong-lalo na yun ang utos ng ating SILG Remulia,

7361
06:41:43,460 --> 06:41:48,280
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: bumaba po ang occurrence ng focus crime by 12%.

7362
06:41:48,280 --> 06:41:49,000
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: If we're...

7363
06:41:49,000 --> 06:41:56,200
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: To compare a period of one year,

7364
06:41:56,280 --> 06:42:02,700
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: one year today and one year before this period,

7365
06:42:02,700 --> 06:42:05,880
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: ay about 25% po ang reduction.

7366
06:42:06,140 --> 06:42:07,120
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: So napakababa po.

7367
06:42:07,660 --> 06:42:11,240
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: That's why, per tourist index,

7368
06:42:11,660 --> 06:42:19,940
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: tumaas po yung pan natin ng tourist visitors dito sa Pilipinas.

7369
06:42:20,040 --> 06:42:20,780
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: We're ranked.

7370
06:42:20,780 --> 06:42:23,300
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: By about 60%.

7371
06:42:23,300 --> 06:42:24,800
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: 65%.

7372
06:42:24,800 --> 06:42:27,100
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: As to the crime index,

7373
06:42:27,440 --> 06:42:29,520
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: crime index, bumaba po.

7374
06:42:30,360 --> 06:42:31,440
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Bumaba po.

7375
06:42:32,140 --> 06:42:32,700
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Sa datang crime index,

7376
06:42:32,800 --> 06:42:34,500
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: nandito tayo sa ranking.

7377
06:42:34,500 --> 06:42:36,360
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Pang-rank,

7378
06:42:36,360 --> 06:42:38,980
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: 45%.

7379
06:42:40,220 --> 06:42:41,240
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Your Honor, Mr. Chair.

7380
06:42:41,660 --> 06:42:42,160
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you.

7381
06:42:42,380 --> 06:42:43,360
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, thank you, ma'am.

7382
06:42:43,620 --> 06:42:44,800
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, I'm sure po pababa yun.

7383
06:42:45,460 --> 06:42:48,680
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And I would just like to see a listing po.

7384
06:42:48,940 --> 06:42:50,960
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Baka ho, Central Luzon,

7385
06:42:50,960 --> 06:42:52,200
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: and Metro Manila.

7386
06:42:52,200 --> 06:42:52,320
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Opo.

7387
06:42:52,400 --> 06:42:56,100
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, that concludes po yung mga tanong ko.

7388
06:42:56,200 --> 06:43:00,080
